 "title": "Constructible subsets of a prime spectrum stable under generalization are open",
 "statement": "Let $R$ be a commutative ring and let $E\\subseteq\\operatorname{Spec}R$ [def-weil-affine-spectrum] be constructible [def-weil-constructible-subset]. Suppose $E$ is stable under generalization: whenever prime ideals $\\mathfrak p\\subseteq\\mathfrak q$ satisfy $\\mathfrak q\\in E$, one has $\\mathfrak p\\in E$. Then $E$ is open in the Zariski topology.",
